\cdot
(1+\frac{1+\frac{\beta}{2\epsilon}}{1+\frac{\beta}{\beta_{0}}})^{\frac{2b}{a+2b}}
\cdot
\Bigl(\frac{1+\frac{\beta}{2\epsilon}}{1+\frac{\beta}{\beta_{0}}}\Bigr)^{\frac{a}{a+2b}} +  \frac{1}{N}.
